### Skip demo: bad rows (every 1000th) are dropped, job completes
POST localhost:8080/api/jobs?failAtRow=0&skipEvery=1000&flakyWrites=0

### Retry demo: first 2 writes fail like a locked DB row, retry saves the job
POST localhost:8080/api/jobs?failAtRow=0&skipEvery=0&flakyWrites=2

### Restart demo: fails at row 5000, re-POST the same URL to resume
POST localhost:8080/api/jobs?failAtRow=5000&skipEvery=0&flakyWrites=0
